# Trust Simplification Programme (complete)

Do **not** restore trust tiers, trust-based ranking, or social-circle scoring.

## Removed (do not reopen)

- `TrustStage` as a ranking / recommendation input
- Just Landed / Grand / Sound
- In Your Circle
- Trust-based ordering and recommendation logic

## Retained

- **Verified User** (`✅ Verified User`) — the only seeker/host trust badge

## Current model

| Layer | Role |
|---|---|
| Verification | Access (who may contact / act) |
| Compatibility | Matching |
| Profile | Familiarity |

Do not mix these. Verification must not boost match score, sort order, or recommendations.

## Contact permission

- **Students:** Offer Letter Verified **OR** University Verified
- **Professionals / Families:** LinkedIn Connected **OR** Employment Verified

## Prefer next product work

**Host Verification & Publish Controls:**

1. Current Resident Verified
2. Resident Owner Verified
3. Draft vs Published listings
4. Publish gating

When the user asks “what’s next,” steer here unless they explicitly reopen seeker trust UX.

## Not allowed without approval

- Reintroducing trust stages, JL/G/S copy, or “In Your Circle”
- Using verification or leftover `TrustStage` fields to order listings or recommendations
- Changing contact-permission rules above
